.env
# ...and any timestamped backup of it. `.env` alone did NOT cover
# `.env.bak.<ts>`, which a token rotation creates and which contains the OLD
# live token -- it was stageable until this line was added (2026-10-04).
.env.*
*.env.bak*
config.local.json
credentials.json

# Manifest backups: large, regenerated, and pure local churn.
*_manifest.json.bak*

